{
  "id": "03-tileop-to-cce",
  "title": "从方言 op 到 CCE intrinsic 的链路",
  "caption": "T.copy 先在 Python 方言层被重拼成 tl.tileop.ascend_copy，随后 AscendLowerTileOp 按 scope 选 DMAPath，codegen 再把每个 op 换成 asc_* 内置函数。",
  "kind": "flow",
  "direction": "TB",
  "nodeMaxEm": 26,
  "section": "4.3",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "u",
      "label": "用户代码",
